==Battleground==
*4 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 32 seconds<sup>960f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 2.67 seconds<sup>80f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**3 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 4.67 seconds<sup>140f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 21.33 seconds<sup>640f</sup>.

==Strategy==
There is nothing too hard to handle in this stage. You can bring [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red Cats]] to destroy the [[One Horn]].

==Trivia==
*The title of the stage may be a reference of the manga & anime series [[wikipedia:City Hunter|''City Hunter'']].

